% Number sequences read as strings of smaller numbers (phone numbers, zip
% codes: nine four three oh five) are combined by the 'num_seq' relation,
% binarized like coordination.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_NumberSequences/):
%   num_seq[L-INDEX x1, R-INDEX x2]

pattern { N [pred="num_seq"] }
